# ==============================================================================
# ReelForge Web App Environment Configuration
# Copy this file to .env.local to configure your local or production environment.
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Supabase (Database, Auth, Storage, Realtime)
# Get these from your Supabase Dashboard: Project Settings > API
# If left blank, ReelForge runs in in-memory dev demo mode with simulated queue.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. LLM Script Decomposition ("Split into scenes" AI Director)
# Used by /api/script/split to decompose scripts/stories into visual scene shot lists.
# ReelForge automatically checks in this priority order. If none are set,
# a smart sentence heuristic is used so development is never blocked.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Option A: Groq (Ultra-fast, excellent free tier: Llama 3.3 70B)
# GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_...
# LLM_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b-versatile

# Option B: OpenRouter (Qwen 2.5 72B, DeepSeek R1, Claude, Mistral)
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-...
# LLM_MODEL=qwen/qwen-2.5-72b-instruct

# Option C: OpenAI (GPT-4o / GPT-4o-mini)
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# LLM_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# Option D: Custom / Self-Hosted / Local LLM (Ollama, vLLM, LMStudio, LocalAI)
# LLM_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1
# LLM_API_KEY=optional_key_if_needed
# LLM_MODEL=llama3.3:70b

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. Voiceover & Narration (TTS)
# Generates speech audio for episode scene dialogues and voiceovers.
# If none are set, ReelForge automatically falls back to client-side Web Speech.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Option A: ElevenLabs (Highest quality natural voice actor narration)
# ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=your-elevenlabs-api-key
# ELEVENLABS_VOICE_ID=21m00Tcm4TlvDq8ikWAM

# Option B: OpenAI TTS (alloy, echo, fable, onyx, nova, shimmer)
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. Stripe Monetization (Credit Packs & Top-Ups)
# Required only if you want to sell credit packs. Never expose these to client!
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_live_...
# STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_...
